  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 14-layer planar dielectric stack on Fused Silica substrate with Air incident medium. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2 (alternating, starting with HfO2). Initialize thicknesses at [155.55, 154.35, 153.44, 139.69, 157.86, 125.30, 113.51, 115.26, 154.28, 123.71, 114.88, 122.42, 155.0, 154.0] nm (Round 1 best candidate values, extended to 14 layers). Apply hard bounds of ±5 nm from initialization for each layer. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with learning rate 0.01 and maximum 500 iterations. Evaluate transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and reflectance in 400-700 nm band at normal incidence, unpolarized. Maximize combined objective score. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
